    "question": "A 29-year-old male with HIV and a history of intravenous drug use (currently enrolled in a methadone program) presents with acute abdominal pain radiating to the back. Laboratory evaluation reveals amylase and lipase levels greater than three times the upper limit of normal. Which of the following medications is most likely responsible for his current condition?",
