    "question": "An 18-year-old girl presents with a 3-day history of low-grade fever, dry cough, and mild wheezing. She has a significant medical history of recurrent bacterial pneumonias since childhood and occasional sinusitis. Physical examination reveals atopic dermatitis. Her older brother has a history of autoimmune gastritis. Which of the following best describes the deficient immunologic species in this patient?",
