    "question": "A 27-year-old woman in labor is monitored via fetal tocography. The fetal heart rate monitoring shows troughs in the heart rate that occur at the exact same time as the uterine contractions, appearing as mirror images on the graph. Which of the following is the most likely cause of these findings?",
    "vitals": null,
