    "question": "A 3-year-old boy presents for a follow-up appointment after hepatomegaly was noted on a previous visit. Physical examination confirms hepatomegaly, but fundoscopic and neurological examinations are normal. Laboratory studies show a normal serum lactate level and fasting blood glucose within the normal range. He has no significant past medical or family history. Which of the following enzymes is most likely deficient in this patient?",
