    "question": "A 75-year-old woman is evaluated for hypercalcemia. A nomogram plotting parathyroid hormone (PTH) versus serum calcium levels shows a point in the quadrant representing high calcium and low PTH. Which of the following is the most likely diagnosis?",
    "vitals": null,
