    "question": "A 2-year-old boy is brought to the clinic with a 3-day history of worsening redness on his right hand. His mother does not recall any specific trauma or incident preceding the lesion. Physical examination reveals erythema and desquamation along the dorsomedial aspect of the right hand. He is slightly febrile. Which of the following is the most appropriate initial pharmacotherapy?",
