    "question": "A 7-year-old boy is brought to the emergency department by his parents due to polyuria, polydipsia, and several episodes of vomiting. His parents note that he has been increasingly sluggish over the past 24 hours. Laboratory evaluation reveals a significantly elevated serum glucose level. Which of the following is most likely to be seen in this patient?",
