    "question": "A 56-year-old woman presents for evaluation. Light microscopy of a renal biopsy specimen reveals findings consistent with membranous glomerulonephropathy (MGN). Which of the following sets of findings is most likely to be seen on urinalysis and further microscopic examination?",
    "vitals": null,
