    "question": "A 24-year-old woman presents with irregular menses for the past two years. Physical examination reveals a high BMI and mild hirsutism. An ultrasound of the pelvis is performed, showing multiple small cysts arranged around the periphery of both ovaries. Which of the following is most likely to be seen in this patient?",
