    "question": "A 34-year-old male is brought to the emergency department following a high-speed motor vehicle accident. Physical examination reveals significant swelling and tenderness over the proximal humerus. Radiographs of the shoulder demonstrate a fracture of the surgical neck of the humerus. Which of the following clinical findings is most likely to be present in this patient?",
