    "question": "An 18-year-old male presents to the emergency department following blunt force trauma to the abdomen. A contrast-enhanced CT scan is performed, followed by a barium fluoroscopic study which reveals a 5-cm outpouching of the ileum located approximately 60 cm from the ileocecal valve. The patient has a history of intermittent, painless hematochezia. Which of the following is the most likely embryological origin of this finding?",
