    "question": "A 52-year-old male with a history of Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus is started on an intensive insulin regimen. Insulin exerts its metabolic effects by binding to a specific receptor that undergoes a conformational change. Which of the following best describes the intracellular effect of this hormone-receptor interaction?",
