    "question": "A 39-year-old woman at 31 weeks gestation presents with a 2-day history of fever and a dry cough. She emigrated from Bali to the United States 7 years ago and has had no antenatal or prenatal screening. Physical examination reveals a temperature of 102\u00b0F. A chest X-ray shows a bilateral ground-glass appearance. A DNA virus is suspected as the causative agent. Which of the following is the most likely diagnosis?",
