    "question": "A 24-year-old medical student is preparing for the USMLE Step 1 and reports significant difficulty maintaining focus due to frequent smartphone notifications. He seeks advice on maximizing study efficiency and objective accountability. Which of the following strategies is most consistent with the recommended 'Mehlman' approach to productivity?",
