    "question": "A 28-year-old male is diagnosed with medullary thyroid carcinoma after presenting with a firm neck mass. During the clinical interview, he mentions that both his father and older brother were treated for the same type of thyroid cancer in their late 20s. Which of the following genetic associations is most likely present in this patient?",
