    "question": "A 24-year-old medical student is preparing for the USMLE Step 1 exam. He reports that while he performs well on subject-specific blocks, he often forgets the material several weeks later when transitioning to new topics. To maximize 'macro-retention' and ensure long-term mastery of the material, which of the following QBank settings is most appropriate?",
