    "question": "A newborn male born at 26 weeks gestation is currently in the neonatal intensive care unit (NICU) receiving 100% oxygen. A plain abdominal X-ray is performed due to abdominal distension and reveals pneumatosis intestinalis. Which of the following conditions is this patient at the highest risk of developing as a long-term complication of his current management?",
