    "question": "An 8-year-old girl presents with polyuria, polydipsia, and visual blurring following a recent flu-like illness. Laboratory findings confirm diabetic ketoacidosis (DKA). Which of the following biochemical profiles is most likely to be observed in this patient regarding Glucokinase activity, Bicarbonate levels, CO2 levels, and Serum Potassium?",
