    "question": "A 34-year-old G2P1 woman gives birth vaginally at 40 weeks gestation. Her pregnancy was complicated by gestational diabetes managed with insulin and mild polyhydramnios. During parturition, the fetus is at greatest risk for which of the following?",
    "vitals": null,
