    "question": "A 29-year-old woman presents for her first antenatal screening. Her last menstrual period was 8 weeks ago. She has a 3-year history of Hashimoto's thyroiditis and is currently taking levothyroxine. Her TSH and free T4 levels are within the normal range. If her TSH were to increase during pregnancy, the fetus would be at the greatest risk for which of the following?",
