    "question": "A 62-year-old male with a history of diabetes mellitus presents for a follow-up. A renal biopsy is performed, and light microscopy reveals Kimmelstiel-Wilson nodules composed of hyalin. Which of the following clinical findings is most likely associated with this patient's renal condition?",
    "vitals": null,
