    "question": "A 38-year-old female presents with a 6-month history of generalized pruritus. Physical examination reveals mild scleral icterus. Laboratory studies are significant for elevated direct bilirubin and elevated alkaline phosphatase. Her brother has a history of rheumatoid arthritis. Which of the following is most likely to be seen in this patient?",
