    "question": "A 33-year-old woman presents with a 5-month history of restlessness and menstrual irregularities. Physical examination reveals exophthalmos and a heart rate of 90 bpm. An iodine uptake scan shows diffusely increased uptake, confirming a diagnosis of Graves' disease. Which of the following conditions shares the same underlying hypersensitivity mechanism as this patient's diagnosis?",
