    "question": "A 56-year-old woman presents with a 4-month history of occasional tremulousness and palpitations. Her heart rate is 90 bpm, and ECG shows sinus rhythm. Physical examination reveals exophthalmos and proptosis. She is diagnosed with Graves' disease. The immunologic mechanism of this patient's condition is most similar to which of the following?",
