    "question": "A 36-year-old G1P0 woman at 39 weeks gestation presents for delivery. She has had no prenatal care. Fetal heart rate monitoring is performed, showing a transient decrease in fetal heart rate that begins and ends simultaneously with uterine contractions. What is the most likely explanation for these findings?",
    "vitals": null,
