    "question": "A 59-year-old male presents with a 1-day history of fever and chills. He has a medical history significant for a liver transplant due to alcoholic cirrhosis and is currently on a regimen of immunosuppressive agents. Blood cultures are positive for Aspergillus, and the patient is started on caspofungin. Which of the following best describes the mechanism of action of this medication?",
