    "question": "A 34-year-old female presents with a one-year history of difficulty conceiving with her husband. Her husband has two children from a prior marriage. Her BMI is 32. Menses occur at irregular 14- to 37-day intervals. Physical examination shows acne on the face and upper back. Which of the following is most likely seen in this patient?",
