    "question": "A 26-year-old woman presents with a 4-month history of intermittent palpitations and heat intolerance. Physical examination reveals exophthalmos and a BMI of 23 kg/m\u00b2. An ECG shows sinus tachycardia. Laboratory studies confirm hyperthyroidism with elevated T3 and T4 levels and a suppressed TSH. Which of the following conditions shares the same immunological mechanism as this patient's diagnosis?",
