    "question": "A 61-year-old woman presents with a 2-week history of palpitations. She has a medical history of invasive ductal carcinoma and is currently being treated with Trastuzumab (Herceptin). She recently started a new medication for a separate condition. Which of the following medications is most likely responsible for the onset of her symptoms?",
