    "question": "A 45-year-old male presents with a 1-week history of mid-back pain and a 10-lb weight gain over the past 6 months. Vitals are within normal limits. An X-ray of the spine reveals compression fractures at T4 and T5. Visual field testing shows bitemporal hemianopia. Which of the following hormones is most likely being secreted by the patient's tumor?",
