    "question": "A 7-year-old boy presents with a knee injury sustained while playing soccer. Arthrocentesis is positive for blood, indicating hemarthrosis. His maternal uncle died in childhood following a mild head trauma. Which of the following mechanisms is most likely responsible for this patient's condition?",
