    "question": "A 64-year-old male presents with progressive shortness of breath when walking his dog in the morning. He denies any chest pain. He has a 30-year history of type 2 diabetes mellitus managed with insulin. Physical examination and imaging reveal an enlarged cardiac silhouette, consistent with dilated cardiomyopathy. Which of the following is most likely to be seen in this patient?",
