    "question": "A 24-year-old male with a history of acute myeloid leukemia (AML) presents with altered mental status, nuchal rigidity, and a stiff neck. An India Ink preparation of the cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) reveals encapsulated yeast with a thick polysaccharide capsule. Which of the following sets of CSF findings is most likely in this patient?",
