    "question": "A 33-year-old female with a known history of systemic lupus erythematosus (SLE) is diagnosed with Graves' disease. She presents with symptoms of weight loss, heat intolerance, and palpitations. Physical examination reveals a diffuse, non-tender goiter and mild exophthalmos. Which of the following antibodies is most likely to be found in this patient?",
