    "question": "A 16-year-old boy presents with a 1-week history of an irritating, itchy rash on his forehead. He began treatment for acne 2 weeks ago. Physical examination reveals a glowing, erythematous rash with visible skin peeling (desquamation). Which of the following pharmacological agents is most likely responsible for these findings?",
