    "question": "A 34-year-old female presents with an 8-month history of difficulty conceiving with her partner. Her partner has two children from a previous relationship. Physical examination reveals mild acne on her face and shoulders. Her BMI is 28 kg/m\u00b2. An ultrasound of the pelvis is performed and shows multiple small cysts on the ovaries. Which of the following is most likely to be seen in this patient?",
