    "question": "A 32-year-old woman presents with a 3-day history of blistering lesions on her face, arms, and hands. She reports having experienced similar episodes of these lesions for many years. She currently takes no medications. Laboratory studies show an increased serum total porphyrin and increased urine uroporphyrin III. Which of the following is most likely to be seen in this patient?",
