    "question": "A 60-year-old woman is admitted to the hospital for chemotherapy. Shortly after the initiation of treatment, rapid cell lysis ensues. A peripheral blood smear obtained prior to treatment is shown, revealing cells with needle-like azurophilic granules in the cytoplasm. Which of the following is most likely to be seen in this patient as a result of the cell lysis?",
