    "learning_objective": "The Bottom Line: Amyloidosis (apple-green birefringence on Congo Red stain) occurs in chronic inflammatory states like RA and in Medullary Thyroid Cancer; MTC is associated with MEN 2A, which can present with flank pain due to hypercalcemia-induced nephrolithiasis from parathyroid involvement.",
