    "question": "A 1-week-old neonatal male born at 39 weeks gestation presents with irritability and difficulty breastfeeding. On physical examination, the infant is febrile at 38\u00b0C (100.4\u00b0F). The mother reports consuming a diet heavy in deli meats and soft cheeses during her pregnancy. The organism most likely responsible for the patient's condition is most taxonomically similar to which of the following?",
