    "question": "A 16-year-old girl presents with a lack of menstrual periods for the past 8 months. She achieved menarche at age 11 and had regular 28-day cycles until starting a weight loss regimen one year ago. She currently consumes approximately 700 calories daily and runs 10 miles per day. Her BMI is 17 kg/m\u00b2. Which of the following hormonal profiles is most likely to be seen in this patient?",
