    "question": "A 3-month-old boy born at 28 weeks gestation presents with a history of bloody stools. Physical examination reveals reduced bowel sounds. Laboratory studies show leukocytosis and decreased bicarbonate. An abdominal X-ray is performed. Which of the following is most likely seen in this patient?",
